# Team ownership + coordination

- One repo: `/srv/sites/nasaspaceappchallenge`.
- Every turn: `comms/STEERS.md` → `comms/board.toml` → `comms/<role>/inbox/` → root `AGENTS.md` → `agents/<role>/AGENTS.md`.
- CLI: `python3 scripts/comms.py status|notify|task|archive`.
- Roles: vps (master), cricri (context + monigote), carne (UI MapLibre/timeline).
- Delegate with `notify` + board task ownership. Do not rely on chat alone.
- `references/` = code drops only. `brand/` = brand source of truth.
- Never put jury/scoring or secrets into UI strings or `comms/`.
